│ patch_description        │ No runtime error was captured, so the validation failure cannot be tied to a specific     │
│                          │ failing test. The original program depends on `std::span`, which is unavailable under     │
│                          │ common C++17 contest compilation settings and can cause compilation/validation failure.   │
