│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The fix replaces that fragile implementation with a deterministic simulator that always   │
│                          │ performs legal operations: for each required box in ascending order, it moves the         │
│                          │ complete block above it to the currently shortest different stack, then carries out the   │
│                          │ target box. This uses at most `2*n` operations and maintains the required stack ordering  │
│                          │ correctly.                                                                                │
